<title>UK: WestLB sets $200 mln four-year bond.</title>
<headline>WestLB sets $200 mln four-year bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-06-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by joint lead managers Daiwa and WestLB.</p>
<p> BORROWER   WESTLB FINANCE (CURACAO)</p>
<p> GUARANTOR  WESTDEUTSCHE LANDESBANK GZ</p>
<p> AMT    $200 MLN	COUPON     6.5	 MATURITY    09.JUL.01</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  101.32    PAY DATE    09.JUL.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  1.625     REOFFER    99.92     SPREAD	+13 BP</p>
<p> MOODY	AA1	 LISTING    1-10-100  PAY FREQ    ANNUAL</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  AA+	 DENOMS (K) 1-10-100</p>
<p> SALE LIMITS US/UKL/GE/NETH ANT</p>
<p> NEG PLG    YES	 CRS DEFLT  NO	  FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> GOV LAW    GERMAN    HOME CTRY  GERMANY   TAX PROVS   STD</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.225     SELL CONC  1.4	 PRAECIPUUM  =</p>
<p> UNDERLYING GOVT BOND 6.375 PCT 2000 U.S. TREASURY</p>
<p> NOTES	ISSUED OFF EMTN PROGRAMME</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
